      },
      "text": "Tabela_Alertas\r\n| where Datahora_Evento between (_startTime .. _endTime)\r\n| where p_comboio == \"All\" or p_comboio == \"*\" or p_comboio == \"\" or tostring(Comboio) in (p_comboio)\r\n// Filtra os alertas do motor a ferver\r\n| where Tipo_Alerta contains \"Engine Overheat\"\r\n| count",
      "id": "1bd784f7-d70a-4fc4-b261-2bfae702356f",
      "usedVariables": [
